fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6733178Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6733681Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6733943Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6734081Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6734397Z see the output, try like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6734612Z 
