archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4472625Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4551120Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4559247Z ^[[0m
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4560254Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4560963Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4561384Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4561744Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4562862Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4563289Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4563597Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4564265Z    if you are ready to continue.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4564554Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4565257Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4566256Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4566960Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4567531Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4567866Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4568163Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4568584Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4568960Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4569561Z    can use Nix.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4569776Z 
