archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4574909Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4575765Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4576280Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4576655Z  - install Nix in /nix
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4577002Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4577440Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4577832Z    /root
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4585737Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4586451Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4594822Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4595815Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4596270Z 
