archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4623049Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4623731Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4624108Z 
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4624298Z If you would like to
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4624811Z see the output, try like this:
archive	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:40.4625216Z 
