host	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6635799Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
host	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6646360Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
host	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-19T17:14:38.6647069Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
